OL,3,GNEWSAPolice urge parents to check bags
OL,4,Afor fireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are urging parents to check
OL,7,Ftheir children's bags after a teenager
OL,8,Fwas found with a rucksack full of
OL,9,Ffireworks.
OL,11,FPolice said the youngster had been seen
OL,12,Ffiring fireworks at vehicles and was
OL,13,Fdetained.
OL,15,FThey said parents should "have the
OL,16,Fconversation" with their children ahead
OL,17,Fof Halloween and bonfire night.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
