OL,3,GNEWSAPolice urge parents to check bags
OL,4,Afor fireworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FSefton Council leader Marion Atkinson
OL,7,Fhas called for tighter regulations to
OL,8,Fstop children getting hold of
OL,9,Ffireworks, saying some were "like bombs
OL,10,Fgoing off".
